#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:5
#: c2482e2efef146339f7534b2aeb4b136
msgid "Hitec DroneCAN Linear Actuators"
msgstr "Hitec DroneCAN 线性执行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:11
#: cab1974e89be447f9f43c24867604f0d
msgid ""
"Hitec supplies several `linear actuators "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__"
" that support the DroneCAN protocol using the same commands and feedback as "
"are used for servos.  Before purchasing, ensure the product description "
"includes the word \"DroneCAN\"."
msgstr ""
"Hitec 提供多种 `线性执行器 "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__，支持"
" DroneCAN 协议，使用与舵机相同的命令和反馈。购买前请确认产品描述中包含「DroneCAN」字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:14
#: 064a109d272b4acf8af8339f64c9d046
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:16
#: 4c97fe2083a64ff093ac037c5f17ff97
msgid ""
"Hitec linear actuators can be purchased `directly from Hitec "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__"
" or from their `distributors <https://hitecrcd.com/distributors/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Hitec 线性执行器可从 `Hitec 直购 "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__"
" 或其 `经销商 <https://hitecrcd.com/distributors/>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:19
#: c93bf819ec544ea3af7857dc8b23493d
msgid "Setup and Configuration"
msgstr "设置与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:25
#: 661aa24e76ac4672a72d3d390be4f8a5
msgid ""
"Connect the linear actuator to the autopilot and power supply as shown above"
" and set the following parameters:"
msgstr "按上图所示将线性执行器连接到飞控和电源，并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:27
#: e485e65abbc94ec4b0d82bb245ccd273
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First Driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:28
#: fd003095010b464d93377435aa7028a2
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:29
#: 3313f73265a34653bea6e37a686b3c49
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>`: bitmask of servo output channels "
"that should be sent via DroneCAN.  E.g. \"256\" for Servo9"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>`：应通过 DroneCAN "
"发送的舵机输出通道位掩码。例如，Servo9 使用「256」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:30
#: 4a96550ebf864255931c50323b9c4b5d
msgid ""
"(Optionally) :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>`: rate that servo "
"outputs are sent from the autopilot to the actuator"
msgstr "（可选）:ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>`：飞控向执行器发送舵机输出的速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:32
#: df00ed3ae0294495a7b6087afe5ec0fa
msgid ""
"Use the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI Tool <common-uavcan-gui>` or Mission Planner's "
"DroneCAN/UAVCAN screen to confirm communication with the autopilot is "
"working correctly and to set the actuator's ServoId parameter"
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI 工具 <common-uavcan-gui>` 或 Mission Planner 的 "
"DroneCAN/UAVCAN 界面确认与飞控的通信正常，并设置执行器的 ServoId 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:38
#: 4b764aec72f1475aa44b61db0d0bba80
msgid "If using Misison Planner"
msgstr "如果使用 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:40
#: d4d3dea1ca8c44c7aee3050ee1c6acf3
msgid "Open Setup, Optional Hardware, DroneCAN/UAVCAN"
msgstr "打开 Setup，Optional Hardware，DroneCAN/UAVCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:41
#: 2fd1210e91bf45f5a125d95dfc1a9c0d
msgid "Select MAVLinkCAN1 from the drop-down an press \"Connect\""
msgstr "从下拉菜单选择 MAVLinkCAN1 并点击「Connect」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:42
#: 09ca9cca8427491784a7252f0d2b31cc
msgid ""
"\"hitecrcd.servo.hls\" should appear in the list.  From the right side "
"select Menu, Parameters"
msgstr "列表中应出现「hitecrcd.servo.hls」。从右侧选择 Menu，Parameters"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:43
#: 8482fd7ca30b43c1b69be8717b8b9c39
msgid ""
"Set \"ServoID\" to the servo output channel that the linear actuator should "
"take its position from (e.g. \"9\" to mirror SERVO9's output)"
msgstr "将「ServoID」设置为线性执行器应从中获取位置的舵机输出通道（例如设为「9」以镜像 SERVO9 的输出）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:44
#: c27f144683f146dfa09e2ac53a21cdc1
msgid "Reboot the autopilot and linear actuator"
msgstr "重启飞控和线性执行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:51
#: 5234f24fe2424fb9897a63db52b81337
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hitec-dronecan-linear-actuator.rst:53
#: 3137adeede9f4e7e9d4921a0efd4c176
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's Data, Servo/Relay tab and use the Low, Mid and High "
"buttons to test the actuator moves as expected"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的 Data，Servo/Relay 标签页，使用 Low、Mid 和 High 按钮测试执行器是否按预期运动"
